<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Passenger</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Datura</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">53iB7e52u7afKK97orNIs4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s 2pm we just woke up. My skin is crawling &amp; I’m feeling rough.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The daylight slowly drips away. Still I got that feeling, you know the one.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the back of your head, on the tip of your tongue. I’m your passenger driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pulled through the world by my feet. I’m scared of what it’s doing to me.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The mirror’s making fun of me. Everybody’s so famous.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Everything is so heinous. If we leave would you blame us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Do you need to know what my name is? I’m your passenger driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause a drop in the ocean never hurt no one. Just live in the moment, gotta bite your tongue. I pulled the thread &amp; came undone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s bigger than me, bigger than us. I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m your passenger, driving alone.</p></div></body></tt>